; Stage-7 OD of the gateway as CANopen master (configurations 2 and 4).
; Node-ID 0x7F -> heartbeat 0x77F (100 ms). Up to 7 nodes (set S7; S2 uses
; nodes 1 and 2, the PDOs of the others are disabled at run time).
;   RPDO n (0x1400+n-1): TPDO of node n, COB-ID 0x180+n, asynchronous (255),
;                        mapped to 0x2200:n (feedback of node n, to EtherCAT)
;   TPDO n (0x1800+n-1): RPDO of node n, COB-ID 0x200+n, synchronous (1),
;                        mapped to 0x2300:n (set-point of node n, from EtherCAT)
; SYNC producer 0x080 with period 0: the SYNC is transmitted by the cycle
; generator of the gateway (fixed phase to the EtherCAT cycle, R5), not by
; the timer of the stack. Heartbeat consumers of nodes 1..7: 250 ms.
; Generated objects only; regenerate gateway_master_od.c with dcf2dev.

